name: Payment fraud starter
tagline: "Synthetic payment attempts, SIM changes and disputes - a card-number scan at ingest, rolling-window features, four payment typologies and a default Risk Score"
description: "A payment fraud content pack (slice 1) over a deterministic synthetic corpus: three Stage-1 Pipelines that scan every row at ingest for a card-shaped Luhn-valid number (13-19 digits standing alone or grouped 4-4-4-4 / 4-4-4-4-3 / 4-6-5 / 4-6-4, with a card IIN; Unicode digits folded, marks and zero-width characters stripped) and move a file that carries one to the restricted quarantine - a number split across two cells, glued to other digits or in another layout is not caught; five feature Datasets built by sql.template Jobs over rolling windows (each shipped as a zero-row schema seed the first run replaces), four per-entity Alert Rules (card testing, BIN attack, velocity burst, SIM-swap takeover) and a per-account Risk Score with a default factor table. Thresholds are configuration. Pristine sample files land in data/samples - copy each feed into data/inbox/<feed> to ingest."
icon: heroicons_outline:credit-card
contents[8]: "3 Pipelines + card-number scan", "7 feature Datasets (sql.template)", "Dispute labels with maturity flag", "4 payment typology Alert Rules", "Risk Score (default factors)", "4 KPIs", "Dashboard", "Synthetic golden corpus"
